* Each cleared wave of a {{r|Challenge Room}} has a chance to generate an adjacent Red Room.
* Rooms that are re-fought using the {{i|D7}} have a chance to generate additional Red Rooms.
* Doors do not have to open to an actual valid Red Room, and can lead outside the map and into an {{r|I AM ERROR}} Room.

